{"seq":3,"slug":"spot-and-workload-scheduling","title":"Spot 实例与负载调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/spot-and-workload-scheduling","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"spot-实例与负载调度\">Spot 实例与负载调度</h1><p>云厂商手里永远有一批已经买好、却暂时没人用的服务器。把这些闲置算力以「随时可能被收回」为代价折价租出去，就是 Spot 实例（GCP 叫 Spot VM，旧称 preemptible）。它的折扣极其诱人——AWS 标称最高可达 On-Demand 价格的 90% off，GCP 给的是固定 60–91% 区间，Azure 大致 70–90%（<a href=\"https://cloudpricecheck.com/guides/spot-pricing-explained\">Cloud Spot Pricing Guide, cloudpricecheck.com, 2026</a>）。但折扣不是白送的：AWS 只给你两分钟中断预警就回收容量。FinOps 视角下 Spot 的真正难点从来不是「怎么买便宜」，而是「怎么调度负载，让中断不伤业务」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Spot 的经济性来自一个简单的错配：On-Demand 按「随叫随到」定价，而你的很多负载其实并不需要随叫随到。批处理、CI 构建、视频转码、ML 训练、无状态 Web 副本——这些任务被打断后能重排或从检查点恢复，损失有限。把这类「可中断容忍」的负载迁到 Spot，就把闲置容量的折扣兑现成了真金白银。</p>\n<p>需要警惕的是：90% 是上限不是承诺。实际多数用户落在 50–70% 之间，少数能到 80%+（<a href=\"https://www.usage.ai/blogs/aws/compare/on-demand-vs-reserved-vs-spot/\">Usage AI, On-Demand vs Reserved vs Spot, 2026</a>）。生产环境很少 100% 跑 Spot，而是分层混用：稳态负载用 Reserved / Savings Plans，波动流量用 On-Demand，容错任务用 Spot，混合后通常拿到 35–50% 的整体折扣（同上）。</p>\n<p>下面这张图描述一条 Spot 中断如何被调度层吸收：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[云厂商需要回收容量] --&gt; B[发出中断预警&lt;br/&gt;AWS 两分钟]&#10;  B --&gt; C{负载是否可中断容忍}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[调度器排空节点&lt;br/&gt;Pod/任务被驱逐]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[不该放在 Spot&lt;br/&gt;回退 On-Demand]&#10;  D --&gt; F{是否有检查点或可重排}&#10;  F --&gt;|有| G[从检查点恢复&lt;br/&gt;或重新入队]&#10;  F --&gt;|无| H[丢失进度&lt;br/&gt;重头跑]&#10;  G --&gt; I[新节点上线&lt;br/&gt;容量恢复]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[云厂商需要回收容量] --&gt; B[发出中断预警&lt;br/&gt;AWS 两分钟]\n  B --&gt; C{负载是否可中断容忍}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[调度器排空节点&lt;br/&gt;Pod/任务被驱逐]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[不该放在 Spot&lt;br/&gt;回退 On-Demand]\n  D --&gt; F{是否有检查点或可重排}\n  F --&gt;|有| G[从检查点恢复&lt;br/&gt;或重新入队]\n  F --&gt;|无| H[丢失进度&lt;br/&gt;重头跑]\n  G --&gt; I[新节点上线&lt;br/&gt;容量恢复]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>三家云厂商在「中断模型」上的差异，直接决定了你的调度策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>折扣区间</th>\n<th>定价模式</th>\n<th>中断预警</th>\n<th>调度要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS Spot</td>\n<td>最高 90% off，实际多 50–70%</td>\n<td>市场化，随供需波动</td>\n<td>2 分钟</td>\n<td>跨实例类型 + 可用区分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCP Spot VM</td>\n<td>固定 60–91% off</td>\n<td>固定折扣，价格不随需求变</td>\n<td>30 秒（含 shutdown 脚本）</td>\n<td>预算可预测，适合批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure Spot</td>\n<td>约 70–90% off</td>\n<td>较稳定（每月 &lt;1 次变价）</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n<td>配合 Azure Batch 自动重排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来源：<a href=\"https://cloudpricecheck.com/guides/spot-pricing-explained\">cloudpricecheck.com, 2026</a>、<a href=\"https://cloudwebschool.com/docs/gcp/cost-management/spot-vms-for-cost-savings/\">CloudWebSchool GCP Spot, 2026</a>。GCP 固定定价的最大好处是 FinOps 预算可预测——你不必担心 Spot 价格在大促期间飙到接近 On-Demand。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哪些负载该放上-spot\">哪些负载该放上 Spot</h2><p>判断一个负载能否上 Spot，核心只有一个问题：单个节点被回收时，最多损失多少不可恢复的工作？2026 年的主流指引把负载切成「可独立恢复的小单元」时，Spot 才安全：批量数据处理、CI/CD 构建、视频渲染、基因组分析、带周期检查点的 ML 训练、分布式分析（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/batch/batch-spot-vms\">Azure Batch Spot VMs, learn.microsoft.com</a>）。</p>\n<p>反过来，有状态且没有显式故障转移的负载——单实例数据库、需要本地磁盘持久化的有状态服务——除非你已经构建了 failover，否则应留在 On-Demand（<a href=\"https://scaleops.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">ScaleOps, Kubernetes Cost Optimization 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个量化的检查点经验法则：对一个跑数小时的批任务，每 15–30 分钟存一次检查点，意味着被抢占时最多丢失这么多进度（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/batch/batch-spot-vms\">Azure Batch, 2026</a>）。检查点频率本质是「存盘开销」和「中断损失」之间的权衡。若一次中断造成的期望损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = p \\cdot \\frac{T}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间中断概率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是检查点间隔，那么把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 减半就能把期望损失减半，代价是存盘次数翻倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分散度决定中断率\">分散度决定中断率</h2><p>Spot 中断不是随机噪声，而是某个「容量池」（实例类型 × 可用区的组合）被收紧的信号。把所有 Spot 押在单一池上，等于把所有鸡蛋放在同一个随时可能被抽走的篮子里。AWS 的最佳实践是跨实例类型和可用区保持弹性：分散到 6 种以上实例类型、铺满所有可用区，能显著降低同时中断的概率（<a href=\"https://www.opsima.ai/blog/spot-fleet-auto-scaling-best-practices\">Opsima, Spot Fleet Best Practices 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>AWS 提供多种分配策略，它们的取舍是「省钱」对「稳」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lowest-price</code>：只挑最便宜的池，中断率最高，几乎不推荐用于生产。</li>\n<li><code>capacity-optimized</code>：挑当前容量最充裕的池，即「最不可能被很快回收」的池。</li>\n<li><code>price-capacity-optimized</code>：在容量充裕的池里再挑便宜的——它的中断率与 capacity-optimized 相当，但总价更低，这是 2026 年的默认推荐（<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/APIReference/API_SpotOptions.html\">AWS API_SpotOptions docs</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年初 AWS 还在 EC2 Capacity Manager 里加了 Spot 中断指标：<code>Spot Total Count</code>、<code>Spot Total Interruptions</code>、<code>Spot Interruption Rate</code>，让你能跨区域、可用区、账户量化中断率，再据此优化分散策略（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/01/ec2-capacity-manager-spot-interruption-metrics/\">AWS What&#39;s New, 2026-01</a>）。FinOps 的闭环由此成立：测中断率 → 调整分散度 → 复测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-上的-spot-调度-karpenter\">Kubernetes 上的 Spot 调度：Karpenter</h2><p>在 Kubernetes 里，Spot 调度的事实标准是 Karpenter。它按 Pod 的实际调度约束动态开关节点，监听 Spot 中断预警后会主动排空节点、把被驱逐的 Pod 重排到新节点或现有容量，整个过程同步进行以避免服务中断（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/containers/using-amazon-ec2-spot-instances-with-karpenter/\">AWS Containers Blog, Spot with Karpenter</a>）。</p>\n<p>两个关键能力让 Karpenter 的 Spot 调度在 2026 年成熟可用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Spot-to-Spot consolidation</strong>：当存在更便宜、且满足同样调度约束的 Spot 池时，Karpenter 直接把负载在 Spot 之间迁移，而不必先回退到 On-Demand（<a href=\"https://www.nops.io/blog/spot-to-spot-consolidation-in-karpenter-how-to-use-best-practices/\">nOps, Spot-to-Spot Consolidation</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Spot-to-On-Demand fallback</strong>：当 Spot 容量拿不到时自动回退 On-Demand，用一点成本换可用性，容量恢复后再迁回（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-09-karpenter-spot-ondemand-fallback/view\">OneUptime, Karpenter Fallback, 2026-02</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>落地时，配合 Graviton（ARM）实例往往能在 Spot 折扣之上再叠一层性价比优势（<a href=\"https://zop.dev/resources/blogs/going-to-production-spot-instances-karpenter-and-the-graviton-advantage\">zop.dev, Spot + Karpenter + Graviton</a>）。配置上别忘了 PodDisruptionBudget 和合理的 <code>terminationGracePeriod</code>，让排空有足够时间完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-spot-纳入分层成本模型\">把 Spot 纳入分层成本模型</h2><p>Spot 不是孤立技术，它是承诺折扣（Reserved / Savings Plans）与按需弹性之间的第三层。一个常见的混合模型：用承诺折扣覆盖稳态基线，用 Spot 吃掉所有可中断的弹性峰值，只在 Spot 拿不到时短暂用 On-Demand 兜底。</p>\n<p>设某负载月度算力需求中，基线占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、可中断弹性占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、不可中断弹性占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>o</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b+s+o=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），各层相对 On-Demand 的折扣为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则整体节省率近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot d_b + s \\cdot d_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把更多负载从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 重分类到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，就是在直接抬高这个节省率——这也是为什么「负载可中断化改造」（加检查点、做无状态化）本身就是 FinOps 工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[月度算力需求] --&gt; B[稳态基线&lt;br/&gt;Reserved/Savings Plans]&#10;  A --&gt; C[可中断弹性&lt;br/&gt;Spot 优先]&#10;  A --&gt; D[不可中断弹性&lt;br/&gt;On-Demand]&#10;  C --&gt; E[分散到多个容量池&lt;br/&gt;price-capacity-optimized]&#10;  C --&gt; F[拿不到容量时&lt;br/&gt;回退 On-Demand]&#10;  E --&gt; G[整体折扣 35-50%]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  B --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[月度算力需求] --&gt; B[稳态基线&lt;br/&gt;Reserved/Savings Plans]\n  A --&gt; C[可中断弹性&lt;br/&gt;Spot 优先]\n  A --&gt; D[不可中断弹性&lt;br/&gt;On-Demand]\n  C --&gt; E[分散到多个容量池&lt;br/&gt;price-capacity-optimized]\n  C --&gt; F[拿不到容量时&lt;br/&gt;回退 On-Demand]\n  E --&gt; G[整体折扣 35-50%]\n  F --&gt; G\n  B --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Spot 的折扣（AWS 多 50–70%、GCP 固定 60–91%、Azure 70–90%）以「随时被回收」为代价，FinOps 的核心是用调度吸收中断而非追逐最低单价。</li>\n<li>只有「可切成独立可恢复小单元」的负载适合 Spot；有状态且无故障转移的负载应留 On-Demand。</li>\n<li>检查点频率是「存盘开销」与「中断损失」的权衡，期望损失约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = p \\cdot \\frac{T}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>分散度决定中断率：跨 6+ 实例类型、铺满可用区，用 <code>price-capacity-optimized</code> 策略，并用 EC2 Capacity Manager 的中断指标做闭环。</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 里用 Karpenter，靠 Spot-to-Spot consolidation 省钱、靠 Spot-to-On-Demand fallback 保可用。</li>\n<li>把 Spot 当作分层成本模型的第三层；把负载从「不可中断」改造成「可中断」，本身就在抬高整体节省率。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Spot 实例与负载调度","id":"spot-实例与负载调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"哪些负载该放上 Spot","id":"哪些负载该放上-spot"},{"level":2,"text":"分散度决定中断率","id":"分散度决定中断率"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 上的 Spot 调度：Karpenter","id":"kubernetes-上的-spot-调度-karpenter"},{"level":2,"text":"把 Spot 纳入分层成本模型","id":"把-spot-纳入分层成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承诺折扣与预留实例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/commitment-discounts"},"next":{"title":"Kubernetes 成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/kubernetes-cost-optimization"}}